      "rule": "R7",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "Passing the untrimmed type breaks column-level rowid alias detection for `a INTEGER GENERATED ALWAYS PRIMARY KEY`, because `applyConstraint` checks the original type while SQLite uses `INTEGER`. Fix: update rowid alias detection to use the resolved type and test that a default insert assigns the rowid to `a`."
